{"3862790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skate Style", "steam_appid": 3862790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Skate Style</i> is the next-generation skateboarding experience that puts creativity and control in your hands. Blend physics-driven gameplay with a powerful animation editor to define your own style—no two tricks will ever look the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animation Studio</strong> – Perfect your style by adjusting body movement, foot placement, and timing. Replicate legendary pros or invent something completely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Trick System</strong> – Every push, flip, and grind is powered by responsive physics. Tricks feel real, with feet actually catching the board—pure, dynamic skateboarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Character Editor</strong> – Customize every detail of your skater: faces, bodies, clothing, hairstyles, and complete board setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay &amp; Clip Editor</strong> – Capture your best lines with cinematic tools, slow motion, and dynamic angles. Share edits and showcase your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic Real-World Maps</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barcelona</strong> – Skate MACBA and beyond, from plazas to hidden alleys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stalin Plaza (Prague)</strong> – The legendary flatground spot recreated in stunning detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for the Community</strong> – Mod support, replay sharing, and regular updates create a platform for skaters, creators, and filmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realism Meets Artistry</strong> – From gritty concrete textures to scuffed decks, <i>Skate Style</i> blends cutting-edge graphics with smooth performance, supporting everything from high-end rigs with ray tracing to handheld play on the Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your tricks. Define your look. Define your style.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Skate Style</i> is the next-generation skateboarding experience that puts creativity and control in your hands. Blend physics-driven gameplay with a powerful animation editor to define your own style—no two tricks will ever look the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animation Studio</strong> – Perfect your style by adjusting body movement, foot placement, and timing. Replicate legendary pros or invent something completely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Trick System</strong> – Every push, flip, and grind is powered by responsive physics. Tricks feel real, with feet actually catching the board—pure, dynamic skateboarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Character Editor</strong> – Customize every detail of your skater: faces, bodies, clothing, hairstyles, and complete board setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay &amp; Clip Editor</strong> – Capture your best lines with cinematic tools, slow motion, and dynamic angles. Share edits and showcase your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic Real-World Maps</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barcelona</strong> – Skate MACBA and beyond, from plazas to hidden alleys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stalin Plaza (Prague)</strong> – The legendary flatground spot recreated in stunning detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for the Community</strong> – Mod support, replay sharing, and regular updates create a platform for skaters, creators, and filmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realism Meets Artistry</strong> – From gritty concrete textures to scuffed decks, <i>Skate Style</i> blends cutting-edge graphics with smooth performance, supporting everything from high-end rigs with ray tracing to handheld play on the Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your tricks. Define your look. Define your style.</p>", "short_description": "Skate Style is a next-gen skateboarding game with high-end graphics, an advanced character creator, and a built-in animation editor. Skate iconic spots like Barcelona and Prague, create your style, and share it with friends. Enjoy precise dual stick controls for ultimate trick freedom.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862790/a8fbfb503483eb11afd77adda30f4ae4a1812c31/header.jpg?t=1773573258", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862790/e6d1fee9f5265c8277947749ef1acf5584145328/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773573258", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862790/e6d1fee9f5265c8277947749ef1acf5584145328/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773573258", "website": "https://skatestylegame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-Bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K or AM